ile', 4.8309), ('1428854at2759.faa.mafft.clipkit.treefile', 3.5369), ('345441at2759.faa.mafft.clipkit.treefile', 1.5775)]\nanimals_median 1.4219 fungi_median 3.0962 fungi/animals 2.177508966875308 animals/fungi 0.45924035914992567\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
